# API (Vercel serverless)

- All routes and helpers used at runtime live inline in `api/index.ts`.
- Shared types: `import type` from `../shared/api` only.
- Do not import runtime values from `../shared/` or from sibling `api/*.ts` files. Sibling files are tests.
- Update `api/swagger.yaml` in the same change as any route, payload or behavior change.
- Dev serves the UI on port 8080 and proxies `/api` to the Express app on 8081.
- Return `{ error: string }` with a translation key (`errors.*` or `validation.*`). Never return raw TiDB errors.
- Passwordless OTP only. Do not add passwords.
- Vitest must not call Resend. `notifySandbox()` is on when `VITEST=true`.
